              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary Anne Deck"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I left the eind on my large thick skinned oranges used 2, All in the food chopper til.chopped well. Do same for 4 c fresh cranberries, chop do not puree Make 1 8oz pkg of jello raspberry or cherry or strawberry..your choice, but do not add the cold water After all.fruitbis chopped, mix in the jello mixture and can add 1/2 to 1 c gran sugar..to taste...mix well, then refrigerate or put some in the freezer.. Freezes well.for at least 3-4mos",
            "datePublished": "2025-12-05T06:05:17.872Z"
          },
          {
