            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy M"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this recipe as a template. I used all the oranges, apples, and fresh (rather than frozen) cranberries. We are diabetic, so I didn't use Jello or sugar - rather I used Stevia to sweeten it a bit. I start with 1/4 of Stevia, and then add more to taste (it depends what kind of apples used). Sometimes I add the nuts - sometimes not, to suit whoever is coming to dinner. WE LOVE THIS! AND it feels healthier without the additional sugars. YUM!",
            "datePublished": "2020-11-21T23:28:17.830Z"
          },
          {
