              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Minda Chow"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The 5 stars rating is because DH and eldest daughter loved it with raspberry Jello. Just as good the 2nd time with cherry Jello, but will do it raspberry next time. Cut down the sugar to 2/3 cup and it was still too sweet with the jello. Will keep tweaking but its going to be a regular side dish for our special occasion meals.",
